# Keezly — local environment configuration template.
#
# Copy to fastlane/.env (git-ignored) and adjust. This template is committed
# and must never contain real values.
#
# Points at a credential file kept OUTSIDE the repository (§107). That file
# supplies:
#
#   KEEZLY_ASC_ISSUER_ID   App Store Connect API issuer id (a UUID)
#   KEEZLY_ASC_KEY_ID      the API key id, matching the AuthKey_<KEY_ID>.p8 file
#   KEEZLY_ASC_KEY_PATH    absolute path to that .p8 private key
#
# The key id must match the .p8 filename. A mismatch authenticates as HTTP 401.
KEEZLY_ASC_ENV=/absolute/path/outside/this/repo/keezly-asc.env
